    "raw_text": "White to Host Veterans Breakfast\nMarch 23, 2026\nWHAT\n:\tBreakfast honoring military service.\nWHO\n:\tHundreds of veterans from the 170th Legislative District, guest speakers from county and state veterans organizations, elected officials.\nWHEN\n:\tThursday, March 26, at 9:30 a.m.\nWHERE\n:\tPhiladelphia FOP Lodge #5, 11630 Caroline Road.\nMedia contact: Jennifer Fitch, 717.260.6563, jfitch@pahousegop.com\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
