    "title": "White to Host Veterans Breakfast",
    "url": "https://www.repwhite.com/News/37506/Press-Releases/White-to-Host-Veterans-Breakfast",
    "date": null,
    "raw_text": "White to Host Veterans Breakfast\nFebruary 17, 2026\nPHILADELPHIA – Veterans and active-duty military personnel from the 170h Legislative District are invited to join Rep. Martina White (R-Philadelphia) for breakfast on Thursday, March 26, to honor their military service.\nThe event will begin at 9:30 a.m. at Philadelphia FOP Lodge #5, 11630 Caroline Road. Attendees must RSVP before March 17.\n“Our veterans have given so much to protect our country, and we owe them our deep respect and gratitude. I’m honored to welcome them to this breakfast, hear from those who have served, and ensure they know my local office is a resource to help them navigate and access the benefits they’ve earned,” White said.\nAttendees must RSVP by calling 215-330-3711.\nWhite’s office regularly hosts a veterans specialist to help constituents access the benefits they earned. Call the above-listed phone number to make an appointment.\nRepresentative Martina White\n170th District\nPennsylvania House of Representatives\nMedia Contact: Jennifer Fitch\n717.260.6563\njfitch@pahousegop.com\nwww.RepWhite.com / www.facebook.com/RepMartinaWhite\nShare\nSign Up to Receive Legislative Email Updates\nKeep up-to-date on the latest legislative and community news. Your email address will be used strictly for legislative purposes.\nEmail*\nZIP Code\nSubscribe",
